# 统一源码与文档的仓库存储换行，避免 Windows 开发机反复产生
# CRLF/LF 噪声；PowerShell 脚本保留 Windows 友好的 CRLF。
* text=auto
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
